                                "sense_id": "351da59e-ef3c-3963-8c11-589661f0b1bc",
                                "text": "As it [the inward action of the soul] hath an Operation vvithout the Concurrence of the Body, ſo it is that vvhich doth Specificate all the External Actions, and gives them their true denomination of Good or Evil."
